> This text was originally written on March 12, 2025. As part of my work at LiteSpace,
I was responsible for managing the integration of the Fawry API into our application.

These papers provide a brief, but sufficient, exposition of how [FawryPay](https://fawrypay.com)
works, how to integrate its payment methods in your back-end software application, how refund works,
and how to keep up with transactions status. Moreover, a general architecture that ensures a seamless
integration of FawryPay API, with a flexible design that can adapt any other API, is proposed at
the end of these papers.

---

